---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/global/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | inspir"
  description="Cookie policy for the inspir ecommerce operations website. This site does not set cookies or run analytics."
  headerTone="solid"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Cookie Policy' }]} />

  <section class="py-20 bg-cream">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-dark mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-12 text-sm">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-10">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-dark mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">What are cookies?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Cookies are small text files a website can store on your device. They can remember a visit, keep you signed in, or measure how a site is used.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-dark mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Cookies on this website</h2>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">This website does not set cookies. The published pages do not include analytics, advertising, preference, or consent-management scripts, and they do not store a cookie preference.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">We do not use strictly necessary cookies, analytics cookies, or preference cookies here, because these static pages do not need them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-dark mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">How to control cookies</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Your browser may still store cookies set by a host or by another site. You can refuse new cookies, delete existing cookies, and ask the browser to tell you when a cookie is set.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4">Blocking cookies does not change how these pages work.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4">For more information about cookies, visit <a href="https://www.ico.org.uk" class="text-purple font-semibold hover:underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-dark mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Third-party cookies</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We do not use third-party advertising or analytics cookies on this website.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-10">
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Questions about our cookie use: <a href="mailto:hello@inspir.uk" class="text-purple font-semibold hover:underline">hello@inspir.uk</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
